for temp table cosider this :
setTmpData()-->Just copies the contents of _tmp into invTmpUpdate. You can loop it, but not select/update from it.
linkPhysicalTableInstance()-->	Links the underlying SQL #TempTable. Enables select, forUpdate, update, etc. ✅
- you can not select on the temp table unless use mentioned func.

    public void updateTaxAmountInWords(AFZPrintTransferOrderLinesTmp _tmp)
    {
        AFZPrintTransferOrderLinesTmp     invTmpUpdate;
        InventTransferTable invTOTable = InventTransferTable::findRecId(invTransferTableRecId);
        InventTransferId tr = invTOTable.TransferId;
        real taxTotal =0;
        while select * from _tmp where _tmp.TaxComponentAmount !=0
        {
            taxTotal += _tmp.TaxComponentAmount;
        }
        invTmpUpdate.linkPhysicalTableInstance(_tmp);//fpr all types of select     
        select forupdate firstonly invTmpUpdate where invTmpUpdate.TransferId == tr;
        ttsbegin;
            invTmpUpdate.TaxAmountInWords = this.convertAmountInWords(taxTotal);
            invTmpUpdate.doUpdate();
        ttscommit;
    }
